OL,3,GNEWSA'They knew she was ill - days
OL,4,Alater she killed her three kids'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who was suffering from severe
OL,7,Fmental health problems before she
OL,8,Fkilled her three children was let down
OL,9,Fby a failing system, her friend has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FFares Bash, seven, Joury Bash, three,
OL,13,Fand nine-month-old Mohammed Bash died
OL,14,Ffrom knife wounds inflicted by their
OL,15,Fmother, Yasmeen Ali, in the early hours
OL,16,Fof 18 February 2024 in Sea Mills,
OL,17,FBristol.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
