OL,3,GNEWSA'They knew she was ill - days
OL,4,Alater she killed her three kids'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA friend of Ali's said serious concerns
OL,7,Fabout her mental health were raised
OL,8,Fwith social services and health teams
OL,9,Fwith calls for her to be sectioned but
OL,10,Fthis did not happen.
OL,12,F"They all knew that she was suffering
OL,13,Ffrom mental health [problems],
OL,14,Fespecially from 6 February," she said.
